From 8969e907bc7c9d4be684f0ddcdcf714ef23587c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yassin <yassin@Nixos>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:03:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] dt-bindings: mediatek: describe MT6765 boot hardware

Describe the MT6765 peripherals needed to boot from eMMC and provide
USB device mode, including pinctrl and infracfg reset support. Add the
Lenovo TB-X606F board compatible and allow the existing MT6357 ADC
child.
